 * It decouples the striping algorithm from the actual record model
 * example:
 * <pre>
 * startMessage()
 *  startField("A", 0)
 *   addValue(1)
 *   addValue(2)
 *  endField("A", 0)
 *  startField("B", 1)
 *   startGroup()
 *    startField("C", 0)
 *     addValue(3)
 *    endField("C", 0)
 *   endGroup()
 *  endField("B", 1)
 * endMessage()
 * </pre>
 * <p>
 * would produce the following message:
 * <pre>
 * {
 *   A: [1, 2]
 *   B: {
 *     C: 3
 *   }
 * }
 * </pre>
